DUSD::flashFee()
├── given flashFee.minFlashFee and flashFee.maxFlashFee are both zero
│   └── when amount is anything
│       └── it should return zero
├── given flashMintCap is zero
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should return zero
│   └── when amount is greater than zero
│       └── it should revert with DUSDExceededFlashMintCap
└── given flashMintCap is non-zero
    ├── when amount exceeds flashMintCap
    │   └── it should revert with DUSDExceededFlashMintCap
    ├── when flashFee.minFlashFee equals flashFee.maxFlashFee
    │   ├── when amount is zero
    │   │   └── it should return zero
    │   ├── when amount is non-zero
    │   │   └── it should return calculated fee using flat rate of flashFee.minFlashFee
    │   ├── when amount is doubled
    │   │   └── it should return double the previous fee
    │   └── when amount is halved
    │       └── it should return half the previous fee
    ├── when flashFee.maxFlashFee is greater than flashFee.minFlashFee
    │   ├── when amount is zero
    │   │   └── it should return zero
    │   ├── when amount equals flashMintCap
    │   │   └── it should return calculated fee using maxFlashFee
    │   └── when amount is between zero and flashMintCap
    │       └── it should return calculated fee that linearly interpolates between minFlashFee and maxFlashFee
    └── when flashFee.minFlashFee is greater than flashFee.maxFlashFee
        ├── when amount is zero
        │   └── it should return calculated fee using minFlashFee
        ├── when amount equals flashMintCap
        │   └── it should return calculated fee using maxFlashFee
        └── when amount is between zero and flashMintCap
            └── it should return calculated fee that linearly interpolates downward from minFlashFee to maxFlashFee
